1
00:00:15,935 --> 00:00:19,989
Step into my shadow, let the world fade out,

2
00:00:20,019 --> 00:00:23,756
Leave your noise and troubles at the door.

3
00:00:23,784 --> 00:00:27,420
You don't know my name yet, but you'll know my heart

4
00:00:27,455 --> 00:00:31,468
The moment that my feet touch on this floor.

5
00:00:31,769 --> 00:00:35,542
I am the rumba, slow and deep,

6
00:00:35,616 --> 00:00:38,990
A sacred fever that never sleeps.

7
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,331
Every gentle turn, every breath I take,

8
00:00:43,496 --> 00:00:47,203
Is a promise that I choose to make.

9
00:00:48,767 --> 00:00:52,372
I don't speak in whispers, I don't speak in prose...

10
00:00:52,408 --> 00:00:56,146
I let my body tell you who I am.

11
00:00:56,262 --> 00:01:00,030
It’s more than just a movement, it’s the blood in my veins,

12
00:01:00,101 --> 00:01:03,794
A quiet fire burning in the night.

13
00:01:04,056 --> 00:01:07,701
Listen to the wood, listen to the skin...

14
00:01:08,969 --> 00:01:11,942
This is where my story begins.

15
00:01:12,077 --> 00:01:15,717
I am the rumba, slow and deep,

16
00:01:15,919 --> 00:01:19,874
A sacred fever that I will keep.

17
00:01:36,743 --> 00:01:40,427
When the rhythm takes me, I am whole and real,

18
00:01:40,603 --> 00:01:44,136
Drenched in the darkness and the light.

19
00:01:44,435 --> 00:01:48,239
Here there are no lies, no heavy chains,

20
00:01:48,311 --> 00:01:51,875
Just the pulse of freedom in my chest.

21
00:01:51,916 --> 00:01:55,680
With every lonesome stride, every swaying hip,

22
00:01:56,485 --> 00:01:59,538
A confession hanging on my lips.

23
00:01:59,816 --> 00:02:03,550
Listen to the wood, listen to the skin...

24
00:02:04,668 --> 00:02:07,673
This is where my story begins.

25
00:02:09,865 --> 00:02:13,430
Watch me move... slow as a river,

26
00:02:14,194 --> 00:02:17,416
Pure as the flame that makes me quiver.

27
00:02:17,627 --> 00:02:21,152
I don't dance for you, I dance for my soul,

28
00:02:21,684 --> 00:02:25,044
And that is the truth that makes me whole.

29
00:02:26,823 --> 00:02:30,347
Listen to the wood... listen to the skin...

30
00:02:30,792 --> 00:02:34,120
My name is Ginger and the dance is mine.

31
00:02:34,386 --> 00:02:38,315
Listen to the wood... listen to the skin...

32
00:02:38,465 --> 00:02:41,927
My name is Ginger and the dance is mine.

